Exercise library of the Coach (src/features/coach/exercises/, site/public/exercises/), retrieved 2026-10-18.
Built by scripts/build-exercises.ts. The steps, common mistakes, Indonesian names and English names are written for
this project; no instruction text of any dataset is copied.

Classification data (primary and secondary muscles, level) comes from free-exercise-db,
https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (dist/exercises.json), licensed under The Unlicense (public domain
dedication, LICENSE.md: "Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or distribute this software ...
for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial"). No attribution is required.

free-exercise-db's own images are NOT used. Its README says nothing about their origin, its maintainer answered
"I actually have no idea where the images are from or if they are royalty free so usage would be at your own risk"
(https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/issues/2), and the upstream project it was forked from states about them
"these have been scrapped off the internet, therefore l do not own the copy right for these images and would advise
against using them in comercial projects" (https://github.com/wrkout/exercises.json/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md).
Issue #13 of free-exercise-db (still open) asks the same question without a licence answer.

The pictures come from wger, https://wger.de (API https://wger.de/api/v2/exerciseimage/), where every image carries its
own licence and author. Only images that are not AI generated, name their author, and were checked by eye are used:
56 images of 38 exercises, all licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) or CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Attribution is required and adaptations stay under the same licence.
The copies in site/public/exercises/ are adaptations (flattened onto white, scaled to at most 480 px, converted to WebP)
and are shared under the licence of the original. Author, licence and source page of every image:
https://fit.joyorogo.com/exercises/ATTRIBUTION.txt (generated into site/public/exercises/ATTRIBUTION.txt). The main
authors are Everkinetic (https://everkinetic.com, CC BY-SA 3.0) and wger contributors such as Franpol, philip, utkb and
AlucardEvil40 (CC BY-SA 4.0). The images are separate works shown next to the AGPL code; the licence of the code does not
change theirs.

